    "category": "Plate Steel and Cast Iron, EPA Certified, Up to 1,200 Sq Ft, 18\" Logs",
    "badge": "Best Overall",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "pros": [
      "EPA certified, as the listing states",
      "Rated to heat up to 1,200 sq ft, the size of most main living areas",
      "Takes 18-inch logs, so standard split firewood fits without extra cutting",
      "Firebrick-lined firebox in plate steel and cast iron",
      "Listed as approved for mobile homes"
